<figure class="rop-basics">
  <div class="rop-basics__viewport">
    <svg
      class="rop-basics__diagram"
      viewBox="0 0 960 320"
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
    >
      <defs>
        <marker id="rop-success-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto">
          <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="rop-basics__success-head"></path>
        </marker>
        <marker id="rop-failure-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto">
          <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="rop-basics__failure-head"></path>
        </marker>
        <marker id="rop-failure-switch-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="10" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto">
          <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="rop-basics__failure-head"></path>
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <text x="28" y="152" class="rop-basics__endpoint">Input</text>
      <text x="874" y="152" class="rop-basics__endpoint">Output</text>
      <text x="88" y="72" class="rop-basics__success-label">成功レール</text>
      <text x="88" y="266" class="rop-basics__failure-label">失敗レール</text>

      <path d="M 82 118 H 886" class="rop-basics__success-rail"></path>
      <path d="M 82 236 H 886" class="rop-basics__failure-rail"></path>

      <g class="rop-basics__stage" transform="translate(132 78)">
        <rect width="128" height="80" rx="10"></rect>
        <text x="64" y="47" text-anchor="middle">入力を検査する</text>
      </g>
      <g class="rop-basics__stage" transform="translate(324 78)">
        <rect width="128" height="80" rx="10"></rect>
        <text x="64" y="47" text-anchor="middle">対象を取得する</text>
      </g>
      <g class="rop-basics__stage" transform="translate(516 78)">
        <rect width="128" height="80" rx="10"></rect>
        <text x="64" y="38" text-anchor="middle">権限と状態を</text>
        <text x="64" y="59" text-anchor="middle">確認する</text>
      </g>
      <g class="rop-basics__stage" transform="translate(708 78)">
        <rect width="128" height="80" rx="10"></rect>
        <text x="64" y="47" text-anchor="middle">結果を作る</text>
      </g>

      <path data-rop-switch="validation" d="M 260 118 C 270 118, 290 208, 300 236" class="rop-basics__switch"></path>
      <path data-rop-switch="resolution" d="M 452 118 C 462 118, 482 208, 492 236" class="rop-basics__switch"></path>
      <path data-rop-switch="business-rule" d="M 644 118 C 654 118, 674 208, 684 236" class="rop-basics__switch"></path>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    各工程は成功なら上を進み、予想できる失敗なら下へ切り替わります。一度失敗すると、後続の成功処理は飛ばします。
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .rop-basics {
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .rop-basics__viewport {
    max-width: 100%;
    overflow-x: auto;
    border: 2px solid var(--case-line);
    background:
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(255 255 255 / 0%) 0%, rgb(255 255 255 / 72%) 48%, rgb(255 255 255 / 0%) 100%),
      #fffdf7;
    scrollbar-gutter: stable;
  }

  .rop-basics__diagram {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    height: auto;
    font-family: inherit;
  }

  .rop-basics figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.65rem;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--case-ink) 78%, var(--case-paper));
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .rop-basics__success-rail,
  .rop-basics__failure-rail,
  .rop-basics__switch {
    fill: none;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
    stroke-width: 5;
  }

